  npcName: Luke
  npcPortrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 879771316d3537d4b8a631d56dd98ff2, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Justin! Bro, you're not gonna believe what I found!
  - Nothing bad! Listen, I think I found a way for us to get rich.
  - I'm serious! I found something incredible, and I need your help.
  - I'll explain when you get here. Listen. Just meet me at Restaurante El Sol in
    San Paloma.
  - Trust me, bro. This could change our lives!
  - That's what I'm talking about! See you there!
